  <name>Anything</name>
  <summary>Fast file search tool</summary>
  <developer_name>Anything Development Team</developer_name>
  <description>
    <p>Anything is a fast file search utility inspired by Everything by Voidtools.
It indexes your filesystem and provides instant fuzzy and regex search results
as you type.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Fuzzy and regex search</li>
      <li>Everything-like query syntax (exclude, exact phrase, ext:, path:)</li>
      <li>Dark and light theme toggle</li>
      <li>Persistent index cache for instant startup</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>Utility</category>
  </categories>
